Package: VEPowertrainsAndFuelsSJV
Type: Package
Title: Updated Powertrain and Fuels package for San Joaquin Valley
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2025-09-17
Author: Jon Slason [aut, cre],
Maintainer: Jon Slason <jonathan.slason@rsginc.com.com>
Copyright: AASHTO, ODOT
Description: Contains modules for inputting default powertrain and fuel
    characteristics and for allowing households to override some of the defaults
    with characteristics for their region. Calculates the carbon intensity of 
    fuels and assigns powertrains and powertrain characteristics to household 
    vehicles and car service vehicles. Updated using CA DMV registration data for
    the San Joaquin Valley region.
License: file LICENSE
LazyData: TRUE
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports:
    visioneval,
    VEHouseholdTravel,
    data.table
Suggests:
    knitr,
    VE2001NHTS
Encoding: UTF-8
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Roxygen: list(load='source')
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Collate: 
    'LoadDefaultValues.R'
    'AssignHhVehiclePowertrain.R'
    'CalculateCarbonIntensity.R'
    'Initialize.R'
